1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,360
Ever stood at a bus stop with no idea what's coming, or when?

2
00:00:04,810 --> 00:00:10,858
Meet CrowdTransit, the free app that finds every bus,
train, and ferry stop near you.

3
00:00:11,308 --> 00:00:19,132
See exactly who runs each stop, with real upcoming
departures, tagged live when real-time data is available.

4
00:00:19,582 --> 00:00:25,222
Tap any route, and see every single stop it makes,
from one end of the line to the other.

5
00:00:25,672 --> 00:00:31,672
Rate stops, report live conditions, and help your
community know what's really happening, right now.

6
00:00:32,122 --> 00:00:36,082
It's free to download, with no subscriptions and no catch.

7
00:00:36,532 --> 00:00:39,652
CrowdTransit. Available now on Google Play.
